<div class="r-site" data-r107-page data-family="creator"><header class="r-intro r-intro--small"><p class="r-eyebrow">Creator partnerships</p><h1>Creator partnerships</h1><p>Show how a SUIJI piece fits your world. We welcome clear demonstrations, personal styling and honest feedback on Instagram and TikTok.</p></header><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Find the right project</h2></div><p>Product experiences, paid content production and referral partnerships are discussed individually. We agree on the piece, deliverables, compensation and rights before starting.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Keep the piece and the experience accurate</h2></div><p>Show the actual version, its materials, included parts and stage. A gifted silver sample is not a titanium wearing result. A clear demonstration and honest opinion are welcome; a positive review is never required.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>One story and one useful next step</h2></div><p>A complete look, a charm change or a real wearing question can lead to the relevant piece, included-parts guide or feedback route. The project brief chooses the main action.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Clear terms before a referral link goes live</h2></div><p>Any commission, discount, attribution period and payment conditions are agreed in writing. Design royalties belong to a separate collaboration. This page does not activate a referral account or promise an automatic dashboard.</p></section><section class="r-section "><div class="r-section__heading"><h2>Start with your public portfolio</h2></div><p>Email your Instagram or TikTok links, language, country and a short project idea to contact@suijijewelry.com. If paid distribution is discussed, audience-market evidence can be shared privately.</p></section><section class="r-section r-ice"><h2>Start with your audience and an idea.</h2><p>Email your profile links, audience, proposed content and what you would like to explore. Content deliverables, disclosure, usage rights, fees and any referral terms are agreed for each project.</p><div class="r-actions"><a class="r-button" href="mailto:contact@suijijewelry.com?subject=SUIJI%20Creator%20Partnership">Introduce your project<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a><a class="r-button r-button--line" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/creator-guide' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Read the collaboration guide<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div></section><a class="r-link" href="{{ routes.root_url | append: '/pages/designers' | replace: '//', '/' }}">Designing a charm instead?<span aria-hidden="true"> ↗</span></a></div>
{%- endif -%}
